# Yeung, Chapter 1: The Science of Information

This file maps Chapter 1 of [yeung2008] to the library. It cites the draft of 15 November 2007.
The chapter has no numbered results, so this file defines no aliases.

Module names are relative to `InfoTheoryLib`.

## Other material

* The chapter is an informal introduction with no numbered results. The theorems of Shannon that it
  describes are indexed in Chapters 5, 7 and 8 here, and in `Books.CoverThomas.Chapter1`.

## References

* [R. W. Yeung, *Information Theory and Network Coding*][yeung2008], Chapter 1
